id":"c-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m007-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"晏子","kind":"person","person_id":"5ky_x6i_539","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"晏嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"5ky_x6i_539","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji046-033","person_id":"5ky_x6i_539","surfaces":["晏嬰","晏子"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-046-tian"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p005","quote":"田稚孟夷生湣孟莊，田湣孟莊生文子須無。田文子事齊莊公。晉之大夫欒逞作亂於晉，來奔齊，齊莊公厚客之。晏嬰與田文子諫，莊公弗聽。文子卒，生桓子無宇。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p007","quote":"田釐子乞事齊景公爲大夫，其收賦稅於民以小斗受之，其（粟）［稟］予民以大斗，行陰德於民，而景公弗禁。由此田氏得齊衆心，宗族益彊，民思田氏。晏子數諫景公，景公弗聽。已而使於晉，與叔向私語曰：「齊國之政卒歸於田氏矣。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p008","quote":"晏嬰卒後，范、中行氏反晉。晉攻之急，范、中行請粟於齊。田乞欲爲亂，樹黨於諸侯，乃説景公曰：「范、中行數有德於齊，齊不可不救。」齊使田乞救之而輸之粟。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為、繼位及局部事件暫接；姜齊與田齊桓公、不同時段未名王及同字忌分開。孫子不先補孫臏，子守髙唐不補闕字，索隱短稱與代詞仍待核；未跨篇按同名接人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p005","text":"田稚孟夷生湣孟莊，田湣孟莊生文子須無。田文子事齊莊公。晉之大夫欒逞作亂於晉，來奔齊，齊莊公厚客之。晏嬰與田文子諫，莊公弗聽。文子卒，生桓子無宇。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m005-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"田稚孟夷","kind":"person","person_id":"zan_qcc_jy5_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m005-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"湣孟莊","kind":"person","person_id":"zan_qcc_jy5_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m005-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"田湣孟莊","kind":"person","person_id":"zan_qcc_jy5_AA